Pallet Trucks
Nimble all-rounder
 â†’  Compact pallet truck for efficient loading and unloading of delivery vehicles as well as transport  
and order picking
 â†’  Foldable operator&#39;s platform to use the vehicle as a manoeuvrable pedestrian or ride-on model 
(AP version)
 â†’  Unique platform concept with standing position at a 45Â° angle for better all-round vision and  
a comfortable body posture (SP version)
 â†’  Innovative Linde e-driver control concept for optimum truck handling in the 45Â° standing position 
(SP version)
 â†’ Fully suspended operator compartment reducing shocks and vibrations for smooth operation
